from sys-sphere-growth.replay
# sys-underground-vendor (vendors.c): a trap vendor's shop. Its five traps and their prices
# are rolled on the save's seed and the vendor's index (the same on every seed here). GET TRAP: the Move Right Trap for
# a Red Sphere of at least 5; a Blue Sphere is the wrong kind, the Red Sphere 10 pays. GIVE TRAP: the Bubble Trap for a
# Blue Sphere 7 (half the rolled size). The Spiritomb option is off: the talk counts for nothing.
# Setup: down to the vendor north-west of Eterna City's corridor.
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_UNDERGROUND 232 88 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app ug-vendor
+1 tap next
+1 screenshot ug-vendor
+0 tap menu:0
+1 screenshot ug-vendor-buy
+0 tap row:2
+1 tap next
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap next
+1 tap next
+1 tap menu:0
+1 tap row:2
+1 tap next
+1 tap row:1
+1 assert state underground.traps [1,23,28,33,2]
+0 assert state underground.spheres[1] {"type":1,"size":1}
+1 tap next
+1 tap next
+1 tap next
+1 tap menu:1
+1 tap row:1
+1 tap yes
+1 tap next
+1 assert state underground.traps [1,28,33,2]
+0 assert state underground.spheres[5] {"type":4,"size":7}
+1 tap next
+1 tap next
+1 tap menu:2
+1 tap next
until app none
until idle
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_SPIRITOMB_COUNTER 0
